{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"ea818a9b3d925ad3","type":"text","text":"# 1. 基础数值","x":-380,"y":-320,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"4e8d7ab1d2af4fdb","type":"text","text":"## 1.1 GameNum\n基础的连携数值系统。","x":-20,"y":-400,"width":300,"height":120},
		{"id":"e65b026968481991","type":"text","text":"## 1.2 Condition\n分为原子判断与复合判断，以及等于、不等于、大于、小于、大等于、小等于等判断模式。\n只提供判断的结构与行为，具体进行判定需要 EventBus/Trigger 进行执行。","x":-20,"y":-260,"width":300,"height":198},
		{"id":"f2eae11db71b209e","type":"text","text":"# 2. 引擎结构","x":-380,"y":80,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"843d0c2580343366","type":"text","text":"# 3. 数据结构","x":-379,"y":340,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"77731620e737921e","type":"text","text":"## 2.1 EventBus\n游戏的数值发生变动后，立即在 EventBus 上通知 `valType,valObj,value`\n对 `valType` 与 `valObj` 感兴趣的 `trigger` 会检查条件并触发。这些触发应该被包装好，不允许被数据包编辑者观察。","x":0,"y":-40,"width":560,"height":160},
		{"id":"9d503f8a358dfaeb","type":"text","text":"## 2.2 Effect\nEffect 是物品被持有/激活时的效果组。","x":0,"y":140,"width":560,"height":140},
		{"id":"f8305753272cca8e","type":"text","text":"## 2.3 Funclet","x":60,"y":380,"width":300,"height":100}
	],
